  "release_notes": "### Changes in v1.9.507-beta.9\n- **Userspace Exit Node Transit Forwarder**: Implemented userspace ICMP Echo Request / Reply and UDP (DNS) transit forwarding on Exit Nodes to bypass Windows WinNAT limitations where ICMP packets (ping/tracert) were dropped or unrouted.\n- **Client Route Retention**: Fixed race condition in GUI update loop where momentary peer jitter or delayed keepalive caused the exit node to be revoked and route dismantled.\n- **Direct VIP/ID Lookup**: Direct GetByIDOrVIP lookup for Exit Node traffic dispatch, avoiding packet drops when peer is temporarily negotiating.\n- **Windows IP Routing Activation**: Auto-start and enable RemoteAccess service on Windows host when serving as an exit node, with automatic NetNat duplicate conflict resolution.",
